# 🔍 Coupon Reservation Status Checking API
# ===============================================
# ทดสอบการเช็คสถานะการจองคูปองจาก Transaction ID

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = Bearer 88d9b7900bef3543ce1ac2c18e700ecc737ac610b669912e9d506a9136e2299b
@transactionId = TXN-20250620-005

# ==========================================================
# 🔍 CHECK RESERVATION STATUS BY TRANSACTION ID
# ==========================================================

### 1. เช็คสถานะการจองด้วย Transaction ID (GET method)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/status?transaction_id={{transactionId}}
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected Success Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "transaction_id": "TXN-20250620-003",
#     "reservations": [
#       {
#         "id": "reservation-id-123",
#         "coupon_id": "coupon-id-456",
#         "coupon_code": "SAVE100",
#         "customer_id": "CUST001",
#         "reserved_amount": 100.00,
#         "status": 0,
#         "status_name": "active",
#         "reserved_at": "2025-06-20T10:30:00Z",
#         "expires_at": "2025-06-20T10:45:00Z",
#         "used_at": null,
#         "canceled_at": null,
#         "is_expired": false
#       }
#     ],
#     "total_reserved": 100.00,
#     "total_used": 0.00,
#     "reservation_status": "active",
#     "count": 1
#   }
# }

### Expected Not Found Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "transaction_id": "TXN-20250620-003",
#     "reservations": [],
#     "total_reserved": 0.00,
#     "total_used": 0.00,
#     "reservation_status": "not_found",
#     "count": 0
#   }
# }

###

### 2. เช็คสถานะการจองโดยไม่ใส่ Transaction ID (Error case)
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/status
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected Error Response:
# {
#   "success": false,
#   "message": "transaction_id is required"
# }

###

### 3. เช็คสถานะการจองด้วย Transaction ID ที่ไม่มีอยู่
GET {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/status?transaction_id=TXN-20250620-003
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

# ==========================================================
# 📋 DETAILED RESERVATION LOOKUP (POST method)
# ==========================================================

###

### 4. ค้นหาข้อมูลการจองแบบละเอียด (Basic lookup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/lookup
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "{{transactionId}}"
}

### Expected Success Response:
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "transaction_id": "TXN-20250620-003",
#     "found": true,
#     "reservations": [
#       {
#         "id": "reservation-id-123",
#         "coupon_id": "coupon-id-456", 
#         "coupon_code": "SAVE100",
#         "customer_id": "CUST001",
#         "reserved_amount": 100.00,
#         "status": 0,
#         "status_name": "active",
#         "reserved_at": "2025-06-20T10:30:00Z",
#         "expires_at": "2025-06-20T10:45:00Z",
#         "used_at": null,
#         "canceled_at": null,
#         "is_expired": false
#       }
#     ],
#     "summary": {
#       "total_reservations": 1,
#       "active_count": 1,
#       "used_count": 0,
#       "expired_count": 0,
#       "cancelled_count": 0,
#       "total_reserved": 100.00,
#       "total_used": 0.00
#     }
#   }
# }

###

### 5. ค้นหาข้อมูลการจองแบบละเอียด (รวมทุกสถานะ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/lookup
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "{{transactionId}}",
  "include_expired": true,
  "include_cancelled": true,
  "include_used": true
}

###

### 6. ค้นหาข้อมูลการจองโดยไม่ใส่ Transaction ID (Error case)
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/lookup
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "include_expired": true
}

### Expected Error Response:
# {
#   "success": false,
#   "message": "transaction_id is required"
# }

###

### 7. ค้นหาข้อมูลการจองด้วย Invalid JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/coupon/reservation/lookup
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transaction_id": "{{transactionId}}",
  "include_expired": "invalid_boolean"
}

